  "summary": "The design files contain multiple anomalies, most notably the PCA9685 address pin A0 tied to +3.3V instead of GND (changing its I2C address to 0x41), the MCU VDD pins left unconnected, and the FCC2 VCAP pins bridged to a UART connector instead of decoupling capacitors."
}

